{title: Jannat}
{artist: Sufna B Praak}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Tera hasna [D]vi jannat ae
[C]Tera taveez [Em]jannat ae
[Em]Tera hansna [D]vi jannat ae
[C]Tera taveez [Em]jannat ae
[Em]Ho jannat [D]hai tera mukhda
[C]Teri har [Em]cheez jannat ae
[Em]Ho jannat [D]ae tera mukhda
[C]Teri har [Em]cheez jannat ae
[Em]Ho tere pair [Bm]vi jannat ae
[Bm]Ho tere sheher [Em]vi jannat ae
[Em]Ho assi pee [Bm]jaane ikko saah
[Bm]Tere zehar [Em]vi jannat ae
[Em]Ho jannat [D]ae teri galliyan
[C]Teri dehleez [Em]jannat ae
[Em]Ho jannat [Bm]ae tera hasna
[C]Teri har [Em]cheez jannat ae
[Em]Hun tere bin namumkin
[Em]Karna guzara [D]ho gaya
[D]Allah di kasam Allah di kasam
[D]Tu mainu enna [Em]pyara ho gaya
[Em]Tera ladna [Bm]vi jannat ae
[C]Teri tameez [Em]jannat ae
[Em]Ho jannat [Bm]ae tera hasna
[C]Teri har [Em]cheez jannat ae
[Em]Ho sarheya nahi, mareya nahi
[Em]Dupptta tera [D]jinnu chhu gaya
[D]Tu chummeya si jo parinda kade o
[Em]Main sohneya amar ho gaya
[Em]Teri jhanjhar [Bm]vi jannat ae
[C]Teri kameez [Em]jannat ae
[Em]Ho jannat [Bm]ae tera hasna
[C]Teri har [Em]cheez jannat ae
